--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party source included in this repository
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This release retains SolarWM's H3 geometry/layout/distributed utilities,
FP32-master optimizer, AnyFlow conditioning/loss and SGF objective helpers.
The H3 adapter is modified for independent proxy tokens and segmented causal
attention. Wan/LTX backends and PRoPE source are not included in this release.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Backbones and weights
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Model weights and backbone packages are NOT distributed here and carry their own
terms, several of which are not Apache-2.0. Obtain each from its publisher and
check its licence before redistributing anything you produce:

  MiniMax-H3, Qwen3-VL and TAEH3; each keeps its publisher's terms.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Data
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

No training dataset or scene asset is distributed here. The fixed semantic
palette is included for reproducing proxy colors. The bundled demo room is
synthetic preview geometry. External datasets retain their original terms.

